RockTunnel_B1F_Text_SofiaIntro::
    .string "Bend twigs as\n"
    .string "trail markers.\p"
    .string "Mine kept straightening\n"
    .string "themselves back out.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_SofiaDefeat::
    .string "I did my best.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_SofiaPostBattle::
    .string "I want to\n"
    .string "go home.\p"
    .string "I'm not sure\n"
    .string "which direction that is.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_DudleyIntro::
    .string "Can you beat\n"
    .string "my power?\p"
    .string "Something in this\n"
    .string "tunnel has power\n"
    .string "I couldn't beat.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_DudleyDefeat::
    .string "Outmuscled.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_DudleyPostBattle::
    .string "I go for\n"
    .string "power because I\n"
    .string "hate thinking.\p"
    .string "In here thinking\n"
    .string "doesn't help either.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_CooperIntro::
    .string "You have a\n"
    .string "Pokedex?\p"
    .string "I want one.\p"
    .string "Mine wouldn't record\n"
    .string "what I saw\n"
    .string "in here.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_CooperDefeat::
    .string "I'm jealous.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_CooperPostBattle::
    .string "When you finish\n"
    .string "your Pokedex\n"
    .string "check if it\n"
    .string "has a blank page.\p"
    .string "Something lives there.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_SteveIntro::
    .string "Do you know\n"
    .string "about Pokemon cosplay?\p"
    .string "I dressed as\n"
    .string "one once.\p"
    .string "Something in here\n"
    .string "treated me like one.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_SteveDefeat::
    .string "That's that.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_StevePostBattle::
    .string "Clefairy is a\n"
    .string "favorite for cosplay.\p"
    .string "Don't dress as\n"
    .string "one in this tunnel.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_AllenIntro::
    .string "My techniques will\n"
    .string "leave you crying.\p"
    .string "Something in this\n"
    .string "tunnel left me\n"
    .string "crying.\p"
    .string "I don't use\n"
    .string "that technique.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_AllenDefeat::
    .string "You're better.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_AllenPostBattle::
    .string "Rock-type Pokemon\n"
    .string "live in mountains.\p"
    .string "Something else lives\n"
    .string "in this mountain\n"
    .string "that isn't rock.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_MarthaIntro::
    .string "I don't often\n"
    .string "come here.\p"
    .string "Now I know why.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_MarthaDefeat::
    .string "I lost.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_MarthaPostBattle::
    .string "I like tiny Pokemon.\n"
    .string "Big ones scare me.\p"
    .string "What's in this\n"
    .string "tunnel has no size.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_EricIntro::
    .string "Hit me with\n"
    .string "your best shot.\p"
    .string "Something here hit\n"
    .string "me with something\n"
    .string "I don't have\n"
    .string "a word for.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_EricDefeat::
    .string "Fired away.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_EricPostBattle::
    .string "I'll raise my\n"
    .string "Pokemon stronger.\p"
    .string "I don't know\n"
    .string "if that will help.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_WinstonIntro::
    .string "I draw Pokemon\n"
    .string "illustrations at home.\p"
    .string "I tried to\n"
    .string "draw what I\n"
    .string "saw in here.\p"
    .string "The paper was blank when I finished.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_WinstonDefeat::
    .string "Exhausted.$"

RockTunnel_B1F_Text_WinstonPostBattle::
    .string "I'm going home\n"
    .string "to draw.\p"
    .string "Some things shouldn't\n"
    .string "be illustrated.$"
